 "note": "Atul Ltd consolidated segments (₹ crore). Revenue is gross of inter-segment sales (nearly all inter-segment sales are by Performance & Other Chemicals); elimRev removes them. EBITDA = segment EBIT (profit before finance cost and tax) + segment depreciation. Segment results include part of other income; unalloc = sum of segment EBITDA less Screener EBITDA (which excludes other income). Capital employed = segment assets less segment liabilities; ROCE = EBIT / average capital employed (pre-tax). Segment product groups were re-described over time (FY23 onwards LSC = APIs and intermediates plus crop protection; P&OC = adhesion promoters, bulk chemicals, epoxy resins and hardeners, intermediates, textile dyes); figures are as reported in each year's annual report.",
